\\left(x_t+x-1\\right) \\left(\\sqrt{\\lambda } x_t+\\left(x_t^2-2 x
   x_t+(x-1)^2\\right) \\log \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\lambda }-x_t+x+1}{2 \
\\sqrt{x}}\\right)\\right)}{128 \\pi ^4 \\sqrt{\\lambda } x_t^2}-\\frac{1}{64
   \\pi ^4 \\epsilon }\
\>", "Output",
